{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21356","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:03.874747+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"I’m trying to run the IREE static library sample on a RISC-V bare-metal target (SiFive VPU), using the emit-C flow. my iree-compile command includes:\n```\n--output-format=vm-c\n--iree-hal-target-device=local\n--iree-hal-local-target-device-backends=llvm-cpu\n--iree-llvmcpu-target-triple=riscv64-unknown-elf\n--iree-llvmcpu-target-abi=lp64d\n--iree-llvmcpu-target-cpu-features=+m,+a,+f,+d,+c\n```\nThe compilation succeeds and generates the .c and .h files as expected, but the program hangs during execution at:\n```\n// Invoke call.\nif (iree_status_is_ok(status)) {\n  status = iree_runtime_call_invoke(&call, /*flags=*/0);\n}\n```\nI suspect the hang is due to an ISA metadata mismatch between:\n\n- The IREE-generated object files (compiled with +f, +d but defaulting to version f2p2, d2p2)\n- And the libmetal.a static libraries from SiFive FreedomStudio, which were compiled with:\n`zfh0p1, zvfh0p1, xsfvqmaccqoq0p1, etc.`\n\nI verified this using:\n`riscv64-unknown-elf-readelf -A simple_mul_c_module.o`\n\nIt shows:\n`_Tag_RISCV_arch: \"rv64i2p1_m2p0_a2p1_f2p2_d2p2_c2p0_zicsr2p0_zmmul1p0_...\"`\n\nThis causes linker warnings, and potentially runtime failures, because the emitted object assumes newer ISA versions.\nHow can I explicitly instruct iree-compile to use older ISA versions like zfh0p1, zvfh0p1, etc., using either:\n\n```\n--iree-llvmcpu-target-cpu\nor --iree-llvmcpu-target-cpu-features\n```\n\nRight now, --iree-llvmcpu-target-cpu-features=+zfh0p1 etc. are not recognized by the compiler.\n\nWould appreciate guidance on how to align IREE’s codegen ISA metadata with older toolchains like SiFive FreedomStudio 13.0.0.\n\nThanks!","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21356/comments","created_at":"2025-07-12T20:08:43Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21356/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/21356","id":3225731219,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21356/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDODGgK6M7ARMCT","number":21356,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21356/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21356/timeline","title":"Static library demo hangs due to ISA version mismatch with emitc/llvm-cpu backend","type":null,"updated_at":"2025-07-12T20:12:12Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21356","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55054584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrlvdr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrlvdr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrlvdr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrlvdr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jrlvdr","id":55054584,"login":"jrlvdr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDU0NTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrlvdr/orgs","receiv